# "If X is 6 or more, deals twice X damage instead": with X = 5 the total stays 5 (CR 601.2d, 120.3). Divided as 1 and 4
# between Bot2's Soldier token and its Elspeth, Storm Slayer (a planeswalker is a legal target, CR 115.1), the Soldier dies and
# Elspeth, at 6 loyalty after her +1, is at 2: had the damage been doubled she would be gone. Seven of the eight mana
# Bot1's Lotus, four Moxen and Sol Ring give pay {5}{R}{R}.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Sol Ring
Shatterskull Smashing
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Elspeth, Storm Slayer
Plains x3
Plains x10

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elspeth, Storm Slayer.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Elspeth, Storm Slayer.Activate(Ability: #1)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Shatterskull Smashing.Cast(X: 5)
Bot1.Divide(Bot2.Battlefield.Soldier Token#1: 1; Bot2.Battlefield.Elspeth, Storm Slayer: 4)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Elspeth, Storm Slayer.Counters.Loyalty = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Soldier Token.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 2
